3T17:08:56.283","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"C"},{"name":"SubType","displayName":"Creature Type or Sub Type","value":"Summon Merfolk"},{"name":"P","displayName":"P","value":"1"},{"name":"T","displayName":"T","value":"1"},{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"U, T: Counters a target spell if caster of target spell does not pay an additional 1. Play this ability as an interrupt."},{"name":"FlavorText","displayName":"Flavor","value":"<em>\"Come back, cowards! Everyone knows Merfolk can't wield magic!\"\r\n<br>\r\n—Pashadar Dirf, Goblin Flotilla Commander, last words</em>"}]},{"productId":18262,"name":"Vodalian Mage (Hoover)","cleanName":"Vodalian Mage Hoover","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/18262_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":41,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/18262/magic-fallen-empires-vodalian-mage-hoover","modifiedOn":"2025-04-23T17:07:37.777","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"C"},{"name":"SubType","displayName":"Creature Type or Sub Type","value":"Summon Merfolk"},{"name":"P","displayName":"P","value":"1"},{"name":"T","displayName":"T","value":"1"},{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"U, T: Counters a target spell if caster of target spell does not pay an additional 1. Play this ability as an interrupt."},{"name":"FlavorText","displayName":"Flavor","value":"<em>Vodalian Mages were invaluable in magical combat. Unfortunately, the Homarids raided with strength, numbers, and very little magic.</em>"}]},{"productId":18263,"name":"Vodalian Soldiers (Menges)","cleanName":"Vodalian Soldiers Menges","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/18263_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":41,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/18263/magic-fallen-empires-vodalian-soldiers-menges","modifiedOn":"2025-04-23T17:17:35.623","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"C"},{"name":"SubType","displayName":"Creature Type or Sub Type","value":"Summon Merfolk"},{"name":"P","displayName":"P","value":"1"},{"name":"T","displayName":"T","value":"2"},{"name":"FlavorText","displayName":"Flavor","value":"<em>\"You think you know everything there is to know about battle? You know Orc droppings! Underwater combat is three dimensional. Those thrice-damned Vodalians don't attack in ranks; they attack in schools.\"\r\n<br>\r\n—Ivra Jursdotter</em>"}]},{"productId":18264,"name":"Vodalian Soldiers (Kane-Ferguson)","cleanName":"Vodalian Soldiers Kane Ferguson","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/18264_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":41,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/18264/magic-fallen-empires-vodalian-soldiers-kane-ferguson","modifiedOn":"2025-04-23T17:16:53.027","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"C"},{"name":"SubType","displayName":"Creature Type or Sub Type","value":"Summon Merfolk"},{"name":"P","displayName":"P","value":"1"},{"name":"T","displayName":"T","value":"2"},{"name":"FlavorText","displayName":"Flavor","value":"<em>\"Stalwart Soldiers, you stand against the Homarids for Vodalia and for honor. Your homeland cries out for protection, and the moment has come. Now let your valor shine, and sound the cry to battle. Victory to Vodalia!\"\r\n<br>\r\n—Marshall Volnikov</em>"}]},{"productId":18265,"name":"Vodalian Soldiers (Van Camp)","cleanName":"Vodalian Soldiers Van Camp","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/18265_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":41,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/18265/magic-fallen-empires-vodalian-soldiers-van-camp","modifiedOn":"2026-02-19T20:46:46.83","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"C"},{"name":"SubType","displayName":"Creature Type or Sub Type","value":"Summon Merfolk"},{"name":"P","displayName":"P","value":"1"},{"name":"T","displayName":"T","value":"2"},{"name":"FlavorText","displayName":"Flavor","value":"<em>\"The cooling climate introduced a new threat to Vodalia: the Homarids. Once a minor nuisance, they thrived in the changing environment. Their ceaseless attacks strained Vodalia's defenses to their limit, eventually overwhelming the empire.\"</em>\r\n<br>\r\n—Sarpadian Empires, vol. V"}]},{"productId":27276,"name":"Fallen Empires - Booster Box","cleanName":"Fallen Empires Booster Box","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/27276_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":41,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/27276/magic-fallen-empires-fallen-empires-booster-box","modifiedOn":"2013-05-09T12:13:41.653","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[]},{"productId":27338,"name":"Fallen Empires - Booster Pack","cleanName":"Fallen Empires Booster Pack","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/27338_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":41,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/27338/magic-fallen-empires-fallen-empires-booster-pack","modifiedOn":"2013-05-09T12:13:41.653","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[]}]}